{
  "A month view for selecting a date, with year and decade views for quick navigation. It serves as the DateBox picker and can also be used on its own.": "",
  "Views": "Görünümler",
  "Clicking the title zooms out to the months of the year and then to twelve years, and making a selection zooms back in. `minView` makes a month or a year the final selection.": "",
  "Moves to the previous or next day, mirrored on right-to-left pages. In the other views, moves by month or year.": "",
  "Moves to the same day one week earlier or later. In the other views, moves by four months or years.": "",
  "Moves to the first or last day of the week. In the other views, moves to the start or end of the row.": "",
  "Moves to the previous or next month, or by a year with Shift. In the other views, moves by a year or a decade.": "",
  "Selects the day. In the other views, opens the month or year.": "",
  "The APG date picker grid: `role=\"grid\"`, one Tab stop on the focused day, and arrow keys inside.": "",
  "Each day has a full name (\"Sunday, 25 October 2026\"), with `aria-selected`, `aria-current=\"date\"` for today and `aria-disabled`.": "",
  "Weekday names carry their full form in `abbr`. The title is a live region, so a new month is announced.": "",
  "The previous and next buttons get names from `uiLocale` for the current view.": "",
